{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/庇护反击","pageid":1249,"revid":11009,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4%E5%8F%8D%E5%87%BB&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4%E5%8F%8D%E5%87%BB&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4%E5%8F%8D%E5%87%BB&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>庇护反击</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.BA.87.E6.8A.A4.E5.8F.8D.E5.87.BB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"庇护反击\"><b>庇护反击</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 庇护反击.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c0/8lbejrmq17ze1o55rofen6at81qzo7u.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4%E5%8F%8D%E5%87%BB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c0/8lbejrmq17ze1o55rofen6at81qzo7u.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4%E5%8F%8D%E5%87%BB.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c0/8lbejrmq17ze1o55rofen6at81qzo7u.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />庇护反击\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）受到魔法伤害降低<font color=\"#d68fe2\">30%</font>，替自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有友军承受[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#d68fe2\">魔法伤害</font></span>]，被自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内敌人攻击后，进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"反击\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">反击</font></span></span>]，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">70%</font>物理伤害，每回合最多生效<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>次，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 0.png\" src=\"htt